{"title":"Scroll Sanctuary","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ogre Shaman, Gaunt Ogre, Ogre Charger, Lizper Spitter, Virikh Templar +6 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Sanctuary, a level-4 Restoration spell. Needs 40 Intellect and Restoration skill 25 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from any monster that casts spells, level 30+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>Restoration scrolls come from any caster, whatever school it casts.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"lizper-spitter\" title=\"Lizper Spitter - dropped it in 2 of 36 looted corpses (1/18)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/3765090b26ea5af52165.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Spitter</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/18<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 2 of 70 looted corpses (1/35)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/35<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glamourweaver\" title=\"Glamourweaver - dropped it in 1 of 35 looted corpses (1/35)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab8e44715f741cfa1e45.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glamourweaver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/35<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-sandlord\" title=\"Dune Sandlord - dropped it in 1 of 56 looted corpses (1/56)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/4db2385dcb80af8b039d.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Sandlord</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/56<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+7 more\">+7 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 9 of 788 looted corpses (1/88)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/88<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - dropped it in 2 of 176 looted corpses (1/88)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/88<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 1 of 174 looted corpses (1/174)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/174<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 3 of 850 looted corpses (1/283)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/283<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - dropped it in 1 of 300 looted corpses (1/300)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/300<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 1 of 420 looted corpses (1/420)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/420<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 2 of 1,243 looted corpses (1/622)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/622<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-sanctuary\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/d65310365631cac7ee0b.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Sanctuary\"></div><h3>Scroll Sanctuary</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>11 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 8:17:31 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}